// A round ends one of two ways: good (accuracy 80% or more over at least five catches, or a new best score at 60% or more; Dafa, 11 Nov: a bad round was being cheered) gets a firefly salute and a warm sky; weak gets no punishment, the hero sits down and one escaped note circles back as an invitation. The result card waits until the ending has played.
